  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RAF:Sverige-Sydafrika samarbetet, utst&#xe4;llning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RAF:Sweden-South Africa cooperation, exhibition - Sweden-South Africa cooperatio</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det bilaterala utvecklingssamarbetet mellan Sverige och Sydafrika fasas ut efter december 2013. Ambassaden har beslutat att fira de m&#xe5;nga resultat och h&#xf6;jdpunkter av detta samarbete genom en utst&#xe4;llning under den binationella komissionen, Pretora, 9-10 oktober 2013.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The bilateral development cooperation with South Africa ends in December 2013. The Embassy has decided to celebrate the many results and highlights of the cooperation between Sweden and South Africa during an exhibtion 9-10 october during the BNC, Pretoria.</narrative>
  </description>
